                                    <h2><span class="shaft"><img id="628-0" src="//cdn.recordinghacks.com/images/icons/patterns/icon_8.png" width=27 height=27 alt="Bidirectional" title="Bidirectional" ></span>Apex Electronics 215</h2>
                    
                    <h2 class="sub">                    Bidirectional Ribbon Microphone</h2>
                    <p>The Apex 215 is a Chinese dual-ribbon microphone. It is a rebadged ShuaiYin SYR50 / Alctron HRM-14B.</p><p>Because passive ribbon motors traditionally have lower sensitivity than condenser designs, the use of a second ribbon &#8212; usually mounted side-by-side with the first &#8212; can raise sensitivity and output level.<p>Permalink: <a href="//recordinghacks.com/microphones/Apex-Electronics/215">Apex Electronics 215</a></p>
